<title>UK: Rheinboden Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark Oct 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark Oct 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager Sal Oppenheim has bee priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    17.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.14     PAY DATE  S-06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    98.98     SPREAD	+13.5 BP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6.5 BP    SELL CONC  16 BP    LISTING	DUSS</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 120</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
